---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">About Dignity</h1>
    
    <!-- IMAGE -->
    <img src="/images/dignity-headshot.jpg" alt="Dignity Amenaghawon" class="w-full md:w-1/2 h-auto rounded-lg mb-8 shadow-sm" />

    <div class="prose prose-lg text-slate-700 space-y-6">
      <p>
        Dignity Airhuoyuwa Amenaghawon is a Nigerian policy analyst, youth advocate, and the Founder of the Dignified Future Initiative (DFI). With a background in International Studies and Diplomacy, his work focuses on bridging the gap between policy theory and practical community development.
      </p>
      <p>
        He has led significant initiatives, including an EU-funded project in Edo State focused on legislative training for young leaders, which resulted in a policy recommendation for a State Youth Advisory Council. His commitment to civic engagement has also seen him represent Nigeria at the ECOWAS 2024 Youth Summit in Accra, Ghana.
      </p>
      <p>
        Dignity holds a strong belief in the power of education, research, and mentorship to create pathways for a dignified future for young people across Africa.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
